          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The flame drake expels a ball of flame to a range of 180 feet that explodes in a 20-foot burst. Creatures in the burst take 6d6 fire damage (check (reflex, dc:22, basic, options:area-effect) save).\nThe flame drake can't use Fireball Breath again for 1d6.",
