      "disable": "check (arcana, dc:25) or check (religion, dc:25) (expert) to disrupt the images; check (occultism, dc:26) (expert) to shout a countering chant; check (intimidation, dc:27) (expert) to scare the images away; check (will, dc:28) save (expert) to refuse to listen",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(1 per PC) The hazard targets a PC and uses cruel temptation\nSpecial The hazard continues each round until defeated, and the hallway's end cannot be reached until the hazard is stopped.",
