          "name": "Alchemical Grenades",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Tsemone carries 9 alchemical grenades that deal either acid, cold, or fire damage plus 2 persistent damage and 2 splash damage of the same type (three of each). She replenishes these grenades each day.",
