          "id": "NsPtduTDFI5ybGKJ",
          "name": "Shake",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The Granite Ox awakens from slumber\nEffect Creatures in area F2 are thrown hundreds of feet from the peak of the Ox's horn onto its back. Each creature takes falling damage as if they fell 60 feet 30 bludgeoning damage), with a check (reflex, dc:31) save. Creatures can arrest their fall with spells like Gentle Landing, as normal. In addition, the result determines how far the PC must travel in order to escape the Ox's tail in the Swatted Like Flies hazard.\nCritical Success The PC must travel 20 feet.\nSuccess The PC must travel 40 feet.\nFailure The PC must travel 60 feet.\nCritical Failure As failure, and the PC is Stunned 1.",
