          "name": "Miserable Remorse",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "A creature damaged by the shade's claw Strike is overcome with feelings of remorse and must attempt a check (will, dc:29) save.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature is Stupefied 1 for 1 round.\nFailure The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 minute.\nCritical Failure As failure, and the creature is Stunned 1 for 1 round.",
