          "description": "Frequency once per day\nRequirements Maddenmist is carrying his staff\nEffect Maddenmist expends the magical power stored in his greater staff of arcane might. During the current turn, Maddenmist can cast one spell he prepared today and already cast without spending a spell slot. He must still Cast the Spell and meet the spell's other requirements.",
