          "id": "7ol1VPXcYU3mir7h",
          "name": "Glimpse Uncertain Future",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Requirements Liralarue isn't stupefied\nTrigger Liralarue fails a saving throw or attack roll\nEffect Liralarue rerolls the saving throw or attack roll that triggered this reaction. She then experiences confusing visions of multiple futures all at once and becomes Stupefied 1 until the end of her next turn.",
          "traits": [
            "arcane",
            "fortune"
          ]
