          "id": "aKS5AOzexUvr1dnp",
          "name": "The Thorns Need Blood",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A person attempts to damage the vines or to Interact with the skeleton or its armor\nEffect The thorny vines suddenly animate, and in so doing, make it appear that the skeleton is rising to attack. The vines lash out, and all creatures in area B2b or within 20 feet above take 8d6 slashing damage from the thorns (check (reflex, dc:29, basic) save). A creature that fails the save also takes 1d6 persistent bleed damage 2d6 persistent bleed damage on a critical failure).",
