          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Arth pulls the rope attached to his hook. If he has no creature hooked, the fish hook returns to his hand. If a creature is hooked, Arth attempts an check (athletics, against:fortitude, options:forced-movement) check against the creature's Fortitude DC, pulling it up to 30 feet closer on a success (60 feet on a critical success).",
