      "disable": "check (acrobatics, dc:21) to turn away from the explosions, or check (crafting, dc:25) to identify the exact moment the fireworks will explode",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(1 action; visual) The Thin Wisps continue to launch fireworks until the dottari excruciator divisions are defeated. Each round, all creatures must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:24, options:area-effect,inflicts:dazzled,inflicts:deafened,inflicts:blinded, traits:visual) save or be Dazzled and Deafened for 1 round (or Blinded and deafened for 1 round on a critical failure).",
