          "description": "Trigger A living creature touches one of the crates\nEffect A cloud of knives rises from the boxes in a 10-foot radius around the touched crate and stabs all creatures in its area, dealing 10d4 slashing damage (check (reflex, dc:34, basic) save). The hazard then rolls initiative.",
