      "routine": "(1 action) The storm tosses the ship in a random direction (roll 1d8 to determine). All creatures on the ship that aren't lashed to it are moved 10 feet in that direction and must attempt a check (reflex, dc:30) save or Sailing Lore check as the waves pummel them.\nCritical Success The creature takes no damage and can avoid being moved 10 feet if it wishes.\nSuccess The creature takes no damage.\nFailure The creature is Off-Guard and takes 1d12+15 bludgeoning damage.\nCritical Failure The creature is Prone and takes 2d12+15 bludgeoning damage.",
