          "name": "Doorway Traveler",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Oourax has journeyed through 13 red-tinged doorways in Narona and drawn power from them, granting her 130 temporary Hit Points for 1 week. For each Narona doorway that the PCs have sealed, reduce this amount by 10.",
          "traits": []
