          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The captivating gem shines intense light on a living creature, freezing it in place. The target must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:40) Save.\nCritical Success The target is unaffected.\nSuccess The target is Stunned 1 and takes 2d12 force damage.\nFailure The target is Paralyzed for 1 round and takes 4d12 force damage.\nCritical Failure The target is paralyzed for 1 round and takes 8d12 force damage.",
