          "name": "Mark of the Devil",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Whoever kills Meliar must succeed at a check (will, dc:35) save or be visibly marked as anathema to Asmodeus. They gain weakness 10 to unholy damage and take a –2 circumstance penalty to Charisma-based skill checks against followers of Asmodeus. The DCs of checks to Gather Information about or Track the marked creature are reduced by 2. The mark can't be hidden.",
