          "name": "Pleasant Voices",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The bdellavritra isn't possessing a host\nEffect One of the bdellavritra's mouths sings to a living creature within 30 feet. Unless the target succeeds at a check (will, dc:37) save (with a +4 circumstance bonus if the devil or their allies recently threatened the target), they can't use hostile actions against the bdellavritra for 1 round. The bdellavritra can Sustain this effect for up to 1 hour; each time they do, they can affect an additional target (maximum four targets). Each affected target can attempt a new saving throw to end the effect whenever they can't hear the bdellavritra for 1 round or the devil uses a hostile action against one of them.",
          "traits": [
            "auditory",
            "concentrate",
            "emotion",
            "mental"
          ]
