          "description": "Trigger Grachius would be reduced to 0 HP\nRequirements Grachius has a divine immolation spell remaining\nEffect Grachius refuses to disappoint Abrogail Thrune; he stabilizes at 1 HP just long enough to cast divine immolation, centered on himself. He dies, immolated in the hellish flames.",
