          "name": "Monologue",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nEffect Grachius ceaselessly expounds upon the ongoing Hellish apocalypse and the futility of his enemies' efforts to stop it. He gains a +1 status bonus to Will saves and a +2 status bonus to damage rolls with his spells. Each time he takes this action again, the bonuses increase by 1 and 2, respectively. The monologue ends (and the bonuses are lost) if Grachius becomes unable to act or speak, or if he ends his turn without having taken this action.",
