          "name": "Mark of Fate",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "A creature that slays the deific vessel must succeed at a check (will, dc:41) save or be visibly marked as anathema to Asmodeus. It gains weakness 15 to unholy and takes a –2 circumstance penalty to Charisma-based skill checks against followers of Asmodeus. Creatures attempting to Track or Gather Information about the creature gain a +2 circumstance bonus to their checks. The mark can't be hidden but can be removed by participating in an Atone ritual led by a worshipper of Asmodeus who's 15th level or higher.",
