          "id": "CsjEd5qeivupoSsD",
          "name": "Frosty Whispers",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nEffect Voulgarghas sings charming pleasantries from one of their four mouths to a single target within 30 feet. The target takes 10d6 cold damage and must attempt a check (will, dc:44) save.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature takes half damage and is Stupefied 1 for 1 round.\nFailure The creature takes full damage, gains weakness 10 to cold, and is stupefied 1 for 1 minute.\nCritical Failure The creature takes double damage, gains weakness 15 to cold, and is Stupefied 2 for 1 minute.",
