          "description": "40 feet. All creatures with the fey trait who enter or begin their turn in the aura must attempt a check (will, dc:26) save. Regardless of the result of the saving throw, the creature becomes immune to the aura for 1 day. On a failure, the creature can't take hostile actions against the katroome.",
