          "name": "Enveloping Web",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The web of the empress katroome wraps creatures into a cocoon. The target becomes Immobilized and Slowed 1 while it's enveloped in a cocoon (Escape DC 26). The web has Hardness 10 and 20 Hit Points. It has resistance 5 to bludgeoning and piercing and weakness 5 to slashing. At the end of the target's turn, if it has yet to Escape from enveloping web, the web grows, increasing the slowed value by 1, to a maximum of Slowed 3. The katroome can envelop up to three creatures at a time.",
